*.aab

# Firebase config is per-developer and must not be committed

# app/google-services.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It holds a project id
# and an Android API key, both of which are already compiled into every APK we
# ship -- so ignoring it protected nothing and only broke CI and fresh clones.
# What protects the project is firestore.rules and App Check, not hiding this.

